<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8850 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8850 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8850 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1,8875 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 28	   January 27</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8850		 1.8875</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $14.67 million	   $6.93 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
